|* --- substrate return node: hard tie (see the companion deck's header) --
|Vsub vsubs 0 dc 0
|
|*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
|* The post-layout sampler_dff, assembled from extracted leaf cells.
|* Identical to the companion deck's subcircuit; every port assignment is
|* annotated there with the design/sampler_core.spice device it reproduces.
|*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
|.subckt sampler_dff_pex d clk rst_n q vdd vss
|xinv_clk clk    clkb   vdd vss           sampler_inv_pex
|xtg_d    d      m      clk  clkb vdd vss sampler_tg_pex
|xnand_m  m      rst_n  mb   vdd  vss     sampler_nand2_pex
|xinv_mc  mb     mc     vdd vss           sampler_inv_pex
|xtg_fbm  mc     m      clkb clk  vdd vss sampler_tg_pex
|xtg_s    mb     s      clkb clk  vdd vss sampler_tg_pex
|xinv_q   s      q      vdd vss           sampler_inv_pex
|xnand_s2 q      rst_n  qb   vdd  vss     sampler_nand2_pex
|xtg_fbs  qb     s      clk  clkb vdd vss sampler_tg_pex
|.ends
|
|* --- shared clock and reset --------------------------------------------
|* One rising edge, at 50 ns, held high to the end of the run.
|Vclk clk 0 PWL(0 0  50n 0  50.1n 1.62)
|Vrstn rst_n 0 PWL(0 0  10n 0  10.1n 1.62)
|
|* --- the setup ladder: one d source per rung ----------------------------
|* Each edge takes 100 ps and its 50% crossing precedes the clock's 50%
|* crossing (50.05 ns) by exactly the rung's offset.
|Vd1 d1 0 PWL(0 0  46.8n 0  46.9n 1.62)
|Vd2 d2 0 PWL(0 0  49.2n 0  49.3n 1.62)
|Vd3 d3 0 PWL(0 0  49.74n 0  49.84n 1.62)
|Vd4 d4 0 PWL(0 0  49.785n 0  49.885n 1.62)
|Vd5 d5 0 PWL(0 0  49.82n 0  49.92n 1.62)
|Vd6 d6 0 PWL(0 0  49.85n 0  49.95n 1.62)
|Vd7 d7 0 PWL(0 0  49.875n 0  49.975n 1.62)
|Vd8 d8 0 PWL(0 0  49.895n 0  49.995n 1.62)
|Vd9 d9 0 PWL(0 0  49.912n 0  50.012n 1.62)
|Vd10 d10 0 PWL(0 0  49.927n 0  50.027n 1.62)
|Vd11 d11 0 PWL(0 0  49.94n 0  50.04n 1.62)
|Vd12 d12 0 PWL(0 0  49.955n 0  50.055n 1.62)
|
|* --- twelve post-layout DFFs, one per rung ------------------------------
|* One shared supply source on each side: this deck measures timing, not
|* current (the companion deck owns the per-cell current measurements).
|Vddp vddp 0 dc 1.62
|xp1 d1 clk rst_n qp1 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp2 d2 clk rst_n qp2 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp3 d3 clk rst_n qp3 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp4 d4 clk rst_n qp4 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp5 d5 clk rst_n qp5 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp6 d6 clk rst_n qp6 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp7 d7 clk rst_n qp7 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp8 d8 clk rst_n qp8 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp9 d9 clk rst_n qp9 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp10 d10 clk rst_n qp10 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp11 d11 clk rst_n qp11 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|xp12 d12 clk rst_n qp12 vddp 0 sampler_dff_pex
|
|* --- twelve pre-layout control DFFs, the same ladder --------------------
|Vddq vddq 0 dc 1.62
|xq1 d1 clk rst_n qq1 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq2 d2 clk rst_n qq2 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq3 d3 clk rst_n qq3 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq4 d4 clk rst_n qq4 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq5 d5 clk rst_n qq5 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq6 d6 clk rst_n qq6 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq7 d7 clk rst_n qq7 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq8 d8 clk rst_n qq8 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq9 d9 clk rst_n qq9 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq10 d10 clk rst_n qq10 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq11 d11 clk rst_n qq11 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|xq12 d12 clk rst_n qq12 vddq 0 sampler_dff
|
|* --- output load: one inverter per DFF, matched per side ----------------
|Vddl vddl 0 dc 1.62
|xlp1 qp1 qpb1 vddl 0 sampler_inv_pex
|xlp2 qp2 qpb2 vddl 0 sampler_inv_pex
|xlp3 qp3 qpb3 vddl 0 sampler_inv_pex
